{"slug":"99-Nights-in-the-Forest-ALIENS-KEYLESS-KILL-AURA-CHOP-AURA-AUTO-HEAL-AUTO-EAT-45453","_id":"687b37e3eecb8ee1988efd43","title":"KEYLESS KILL AURA CHOP AURA AUTO HEAL AUTO EAT","game":{"_id":"68437b38a7d0bed5d5235e5c","gameId":79546208627805,"name":"99 Nights in the Forest 🔦","imageUrl":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":79546208627805},"features":"Script Title: 99 Nights in the Forest | Enhanced Gameplay Suite\n\nScript Description:\nEnhance every part of your survival in 99 Nights in the Forest with this all-in-one script. Built for simplicity and power, it automates repetitive tasks, boosts combat and movement, and gives you full control over the game world.\n\nKey Features:\n\nTree Aura: Automatically finds and chops nearby trees, picking the best tool and working at your chosen speed and range.\n\nAuto Heal: Uses Medkits or Bandages when health drops below your set threshold.\n\nKill Aura: Auto-attacks nearby enemies. Customize range and speed.\n\nMovement Enhancements:\n• Walkspeed: Set to any pace\n• Infinite Jump: Jump endlessly\n• Noclip: Walk through terrain\n• Full Fly: Adjustable-speed flight\n\nTeleportation:\n• Warp to key locations (Campfire, Crafting Bench)\n• Bring selected items to you\n• Find and teleport to lost children\n• Chest Finder: Instantly loot across the map\n• Mothership warp during Alien Event\n\nESP (Visuals):\n• Highlights for players, enemies, items, and chests\n• Fully color-customizable\n\nWorld Control:\n• Full Bright, No Fog\n• Instant Interactions\n• Time of Day set & lock\n\nSafe Zone: Auto-teleports you to a skybox if health is critical, then returns you.\n\nAuto Hunger: Eats specific food automatically to maintain hunger.\n\nSettings & UI:\n• Optional debug notifications\n• Saves all preferences\n• Right Shift opens menu\n• Easy toggles, sliders, dropdowns","tags":["Kill Aura","ESP","Farm","Auto H